{"content":[{"c":["PASTOR"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Word literally meaning “shepherd,” used in both the OT and NT in a figurative sense for rulers and leaders. Of the 12 times the word is used in the NT as a metaphor for “leader,” it is translated as “pastor” only in ",{"href":"?bref=Eph.4.11","r":"Eph.4.11","rawR":"Eph.4.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Eph.4.11","value":"Eph.4.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ephesians 4:11"}," (",{"c":["kjv"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"},", ",{"c":["asv"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"},", ",{"c":["rsv"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"},", ",{"c":["niv"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"},", ",{"c":["tev"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"},", ",{"c":["nlt"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":["Pastors and teachers together formed a group who complemented the work of apostles, prophets, and evangelists. The titles “bishop” and “elder” refer to the same office in the NT (cf. ",{"href":"?bref=Acts.20.17,28","r":"Acts.20.17,28","rawR":"Acts.20.17,28","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Acts.20.17,28","value":"Acts.20.17,28"}],"t":"ref","v":"Acts 20:17, 28"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Titus.1.5-7","r":"Titus.1.5-7","rawR":"Titus.1.5-7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Titus.1.5-7","value":"Titus.1.5-7"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ti 1:5-7"},"), and “pastor” seems to be practically synonymous with them, as shown by Jesus being referred to as “the Shepherd and Bishop of your souls” (",{"href":"?bref=1Pet.2.25","r":"1Pet.2.25","rawR":"1Pet.2.25","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Pet.2.25","value":"1Pet.2.25"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Pt 2:25"},", ",{"c":["kjv"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"},"). The verb “to shepherd” is used to describe the work of local church leaders (",{"href":"?bref=John.21.16","r":"John.21.16","rawR":"John.21.16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"John.21.16","value":"John.21.16"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jn 21:16"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Acts.20.28","r":"Acts.20.28","rawR":"Acts.20.28","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Acts.20.28","value":"Acts.20.28"}],"t":"ref","v":"Acts 20:28"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Pet.5.2","r":"1Pet.5.2","rawR":"1Pet.5.2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Pet.5.2","value":"1Pet.5.2"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Pt 5:2"},"), and often the congregation is called a flock. It is the pastor’s responsibility to build up the body of Christ by watching over the congregation (",{"href":"?bref=Acts.20.28","r":"Acts.20.28","rawR":"Acts.20.28","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Acts.20.28","value":"Acts.20.28"}],"t":"ref","v":"Acts 20:28"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Heb.13.7","r":"Heb.13.7","rawR":"Heb.13.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Heb.13.7","value":"Heb.13.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"Heb 13:7"},") and countering false teaching (",{"href":"?bref=Acts.20.29-30","r":"Acts.20.29-30","rawR":"Acts.20.29-30","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Acts.20.29-30","value":"Acts.20.29-30"}],"t":"ref","v":"Acts 20:29-30"},"). More detailed information regarding the duties and responsibilities of pastors is found in Paul’s letters to Timothy and Titus, which have come to be called the Pastoral Letters."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Bishop_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Bishop_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Bishop_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Bishop"},"; ",{"href":"?item=DeaconDeaconess_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"DeaconDeaconess_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"DeaconDeaconess_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Deacon, Deaconess"},"; ",{"href":"?item=Elder_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Elder_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Elder_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Elder"},"; ",{"href":"?item=Presbyter_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Presbyter_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Presbyter_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Presbyter"},"; ",{"href":"?item=Shepherd_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Shepherd_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Shepherd_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Shepherd"},"; ",{"href":"?item=SpiritualGifts_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"SpiritualGifts_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"SpiritualGifts_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Spiritual Gifts"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Pastor","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Ephesians 4:11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Eph.4.11","rawQueryValue":"Eph.4.11","sourceRefExact":"Eph.4.11"},{"anchorText":"Acts 20:17, 28","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Acts.20.17,28","rawQueryValue":"Acts.20.17,28","sourceRefExact":"Acts.20.17,28"},{"anchorText":"Ti 1:5-7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Titus.1.5-7","rawQueryValue":"Titus.1.5-7","sourceRefExact":"Titus.1.5-7"},{"anchorText":"1 Pt 2:25","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Pet.2.25","rawQueryValue":"1Pet.2.25","sourceRefExact":"1Pet.2.25"},{"anchorText":"Jn 21:16","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=John.21.16","rawQueryValue":"John.21.16","sourceRefExact":"John.21.16"},{"anchorText":"Acts 20:28","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Acts.20.28","rawQueryValue":"Acts.20.28","sourceRefExact":"Acts.20.28"},{"anchorText":"1 Pt 5:2","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Pet.5.2","rawQueryValue":"1Pet.5.2","sourceRefExact":"1Pet.5.2"},{"anchorText":"Acts 20:28","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Acts.20.28","rawQueryValue":"Acts.20.28","sourceRefExact":"Acts.20.28"},{"anchorText":"Heb 13:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Heb.13.7","rawQueryValue":"Heb.13.7","sourceRefExact":"Heb.13.7"},{"anchorText":"Acts 20:29-30","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Acts.20.29-30","rawQueryValue":"Acts.20.29-30","sourceRefExact":"Acts.20.29-30"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"0f775e0f786c784c9ae3ef9ad15fd64385887b1cd57ef0e491ab9f36f7fb7ace","sourceItemName":"Pastor","sourceItemOrder":58,"sourceMember":"Articles/P.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Pastor","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Pastor","title":"Pastor","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}